# Baraja — Production Secrets
# =====================================================
# Los bindings D1 y R2 se configuran en wrangler.jsonc — no necesitan env vars.
#
# Los secrets del Worker se setean via Cloudflare Dashboard o CLI:
#
#   npx wrangler secret put STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET   ← Phase 2
#   npx wrangler secret put STRIPE_SECRET_KEY       ← Phase 2
#   npx wrangler secret put BARAJA_ADMIN_EMAIL
#   npx wrangler secret put BARAJA_ADMIN_PASSWORD
#   npx wrangler secret put BARAJA_ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET
#   npx wrangler secret put SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID
#   npx wrangler secret put SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET
#   npx wrangler secret put SPOTIFY_MARKET          ← opcional, default US
#   npx wrangler secret put SPOTIFY_REFRESH_TOKEN   ← opcional, recomendado si se usa OAuth
#   npx wrangler secret put SPOTIFY_ACCESS_TOKEN    ← opcional, temporal
#
# Para dev local, crear un archivo .dev.vars (no commitear):
#   STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_test_...
#   STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_...
#   BARAJA_ADMIN_EMAIL=tu@email.com
#   BARAJA_ADMIN_PASSWORD=...
#   BARAJA_ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET=...
#   SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=...
#   SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=...
#   SPOTIFY_MARKET=US
#   SPOTIFY_REFRESH_TOKEN=...
#
# Client analytics:
#   VITE_POSTHOG_KEY can be set directly for Baraja, or the production build
#   can inherit ENTITY_BUILDERS_CORE_POSTHOG_KEY from the root environment.
#   VITE_POSTHOG_HOST defaults to https://us.i.posthog.com.
#
# Client checkout:
#   VITE_SUPABASE_URL points at the shared eb-core Supabase project.
#   VITE_BARAJA_MUSIC_BINGO_CHECKOUT_API_URL is optional; by default the app
#   calls ${VITE_SUPABASE_URL}/functions/v1/baraja-music-bingo-checkout.
#   Mercado Pago server credentials stay in Supabase Function secrets, never
#   in VITE_* variables.
